      "tests": "tests/standard1804-effects.test.mjs",
      "scope": "Official four-player Dueparty ruling; this existing engine supports two seats only. Repeated delayed triggers on the one opposing seat are tested; no multiplayer implementation or support is claimed.",
      "body": "４人で対戦中です。 自分は《魔誕導師ブラックルシファー》で攻撃し、「メガメテオバーン３」を使いました。 「次の自分のターンのはじめまで、相手のクリーチャーが出た時、そのクリーチャーを破壊する」の効果は誰が受けますか？ A相手３人全員が効果を受けます。 「次の自分のターンのはじめまで、相手のクリーチャーが出た時、そのクリーチャーを破壊する」は遅延誘発型能力です。遅延誘発型能力は条件を満たすたび(相手のクリーチャーが出るたび)に新たにトリガーするので、《魔誕導師ブラックルシファー》の攻撃時に効果を受ける相手を指定する必要はなく、すべての相手が効果を受けることになります。 "
    }
  ],
  "validationNotes": {
    "resolvedAttempts": "Initial six Arcaizum failures came from using start with an already native-prefixed g71 operation, which incorrectly produced g34_g71_Plus. Changed only that continuation to the established native put route. One invalid shield-prohibition fixture ID was replaced with registered dmrp22-037. The opposing-turn Dogiragon fixture initially stayed in attack phase; set main before its actual paid summon. Final45 focused tests all pass, including costInfinity serialization and both Twinpact face costs.",
    "sharedChanges": "Exact Shield Plus uses a guarded g1804ExactPlus flag; existing upto behavior is retained. Exact Meteor continuation may reference its actual paid physical source cost. HandUnder1131 accepts existing grave origin and hides face-down mana names, card IDs and cost-based AI scores. A new native extLimit expires at its controller next start and queues full-reference ExactMove for each opposing entrant through the existing turn-player trigger ordering. No new saved schema, IDs, deck or history format.",
    "imageReview": "All original/reprint full images reviewed:1 Spartan,2 Arcaizum,5 BlackLucifer. Printed mana1 on all8. Every exact-name official search print included; alias count5 does not increment names."
  }
